Z||000015||frontal lobe||09-13-2001||04:11 PM||||ANY innocent person in the U.S. being attacked by some ignorant idiot is terrible, but come on people, look at the over-all picture.  What, about 250 million U.S. citizens and 1 reported attack like this?  That's pretty good over-all, considering how many bigoted morons there already were BEFORE this all happened.  So to say, haven't we learned anything since WWII with Japanese-American citizens--well, apparently from the lack of similar reports such as this, I would say our country certainly has learned and as a nation is behaving itself extremely well.||||reg||1
