Z||000020||stsmithgt||09-13-2001||07:13 PM||||Whoooo Voytec.  It's easy to think like that.  I find it very hard to keep from being a racist.  My friends tell me, if they didn't know me, they would think I really was one.  They know I at least try not to be. <BR>I've been hearing a lot about some people celebrating the attack.  If I have one of those partisipants shoving that flag in my face, they'll find that flag doesn't feel so good where I shove it.  I sure like all the american flags I've seen on car antennas and homes though.  I gave my folks an embroidered flag to dispay.  It's 8x10.  That's 8 feet by 10 feet!! OH YEAH!!!!!!<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/flag.gif">  <BR>Onces the half mast display is over,  people should continue to fly the flag high.  I want to see more them with stars and stripes.  <BR>Not so many with flowers and butterflies on them.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><BR>Ok.  some of those flags are ok.  Sometimes you can't say "no" to your girlfriend. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by stsmithgt (edited 09-13-2001).]||||reg||1
